<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>数字パターン予測アプリ (1-6)</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center py-8 px-4">

    <div class="max-w-xl w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-6 border border-slate-700">
        <header class="text-center mb-6">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-indigo-400">🔢 1-6 ナンバー予測アナライザー</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">過去のパターンと区切り傾向から、20回以内の出現確率を予測します</p>
        </header>

        <!-- コントロール・区切りセクション -->
        <section class="mb-6 bg-slate-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">現在の区切り</span>
                <span id="current-session-label" class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-300">区切り #1</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
                <button id="btn-new-session" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition shadow">
                    新しい区切りで開始
                </button>
                <button id="btn-reset" class="bg-rose-900/40 hover:bg-rose-800 text-rose-300 text-sm font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition border border-rose-700/50">
                    全リセット
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 数字入力セクション (1〜6ボタン) -->
        <section class="mb-8 text-center">
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 mb-3">数値を入力 (クリックまたはキーボード 1〜6)</label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-2">
                <button data-num="1" class="num-btn bg-slate-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 transition shadow">1</button>
                <button data-num="2" class="num-btn bg-slate-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 transition shadow">2</button>
                <button data-num="3" class="num-btn bg-slate-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 transition shadow">3</button>
                <button data-num="4" class="num-btn bg-slate-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 transition shadow">4</button>
                <button data-num="5" class="num-btn bg-slate-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 transition shadow">5</button>
                <button data-num="6" class="num-btn bg-slate-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 transition shadow">6</button>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-slate-400 px-1">
                <span>総入力回数: <strong id="total-count" class="text-white">0</strong> 回</span>
                <button id="btn-undo" class="hover:text-slate-200 underline disabled:opacity-50" disabled>直前の入力を取り消す</button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 予測ランキングセクション -->
        <section class="mb-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-200">🏆 20回以内 出現確率予測ランキング</h2>
                <span class="text-xs text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-950 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-indigo-800/50">全体＋区切りハイブリッド</span>
            </div>
            <div id="prediction-list" class="space-y-2.5">
                <!-- 動的にランキング項目が挿入されます -->
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 履歴とトレンドセクション -->
        <section class="border-t border-slate-700 pt-5">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">📜 入力履歴 (直近15件)</h3>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">※全データは自動保存されています</span>
            </div>
            <div id="history-container" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 min-h-[40px] bg-slate-900/40 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 italic">まだ入力がありません</span>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <!-- JavaScriptの読み込み -->
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
